      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx. i guess i'm wondering about the \"higher index of suspicion\" part. does that mean we should be looking more closely because the disease itself might behave differently or more aggressively in these groups, or is it purely because the visual markers are just harder to catch? there's a lot of talk about whether certain ethnicities are more prone to specific types of progression.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
